#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/code-signing-custom-builds.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Windows**: Use ``SignTool`` from the Windows SDK with your imported "
"code signing certificate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/code-signing-custom-builds.rst:112
msgid ""
